<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal drains 18 bln esc with 4-week certs.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal drains 18 bln esc with 4-week certs.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal drained 18 billion escudos with four-week money market intervention certificates at an average weighted 6.24 percent.</p>
<p>The central bank last drained liquidity with these instruments at an average 6.2433 percent on March 12.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 3511-3538254</p>
